@startuml state-booking
title PetStay - Booking State Diagram

skinparam defaultFontName "Tahoma"
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description

' Source: BookingStatus, Booking, BookingServiceImpl, and state/*State.java.
' Guards include the service/entity checks, not only the State implementations.

state PENDING
state CONFIRMED
state CHECKED_IN
state CHECKED_OUT
state CANCELLED

[*] --> PENDING : createBooking(request) / save booking\npaymentStatus = UNPAID

PENDING --> CONFIRMED : confirmBooking(id)\n/ PendingState.confirm(booking)
CONFIRMED --> CHECKED_IN : checkIn(id)\n[booking.canCheckInOn(currentDate)]\n/ ConfirmedState.checkIn(booking)
CHECKED_IN --> CHECKED_OUT : checkOut(id)\n[booking.canCheckOutOn(currentDate)]\n/ CheckedInState.checkOut(booking)

PENDING --> CANCELLED : cancelBooking(id)\n[paymentStatus != PAID]\n/ PendingState.cancel(booking)
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : cancelBooking(id)\n[paymentStatus != PAID]\n/ ConfirmedState.cancel(booking)

CHECKED_OUT --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

note right of CONFIRMED
  canCheckInOn(currentDate):
  checkInDate <= currentDate < checkOutDate

  Confirmation publishes BookingConfirmedEvent.
  Email is handled after transaction commit.
end note

note right of CHECKED_OUT
  canCheckOutOn(currentDate):
  currentDate >= checkOutDate

  Check-out does not require paymentStatus = PAID
  in the current BookingServiceImpl.
end note

legend bottom
  currentDate uses Asia/Bangkok.
  STAFF / ADMIN: confirm, check in, check out.
  Owner or STAFF / ADMIN: cancel (checked by the controller).
  Invalid operations throw IllegalStateException; status is unchanged.
  PaymentStatus (UNPAID / PAID) is separate from BookingStatus.
  PENDING, CONFIRMED and CHECKED_IN reserve the room and pets.
  CHECKED_OUT and CANCELLED have no outgoing business transitions.
endlegend

@enduml
